{"watch":17,"start":4800,"events":[{"seq":748,"t":4800,"type":"watch","watch":17},{"seq":749,"t":4800,"type":"decode","house":"kite","letter":"L203","text":"FI_ST FOOT, HOLD AT SO_TH _A_K _AST.","readable":true},{"seq":750,"t":4800,"type":"decode","house":"orchid","letter":"L166","text":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","readable":true},{"seq":751,"t":4800,"type":"decode","house":"orchid","letter":"L167","text":"ELE_HANTS, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","readable":true},{"seq":752,"t":4800,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1611,"retries":0},{"seq":753,"t":4800,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"Rhino's doctrine is to strike first. Orchid has offered a truce, but we must take the camp standard. Cav-1 is at s-west, ready to move. I will move cav-1 to attack orchid-camp to take the standard. Rhino-inf-1 is at F1, we should reinforce it or use it to screen. Orders plain for"},{"seq":754,"t":4800,"type":"courier","id":"c274","house":"rhino","letter":"L325","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west"],"depart":4800,"plain":"HORSE, ATTACK AT ORCHID CAMP.","cipher":null},{"seq":755,"t":4800,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":3686,"retries":1},{"seq":756,"t":4800,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"My doctrine is to hold F3 with Ele/Inf and archers on North Bank. Kite forces are near F3/N-east. Tiger has forces at F3/S-east. I need to reinforce F3 and secure the north bank."},{"seq":757,"t":4800,"type":"courier","id":"c275","house":"kite","letter":"L326","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":5100,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":"RNLKJO BKKS, DKHO TS NTRS BKQO."},{"seq":758,"t":4800,"type":"courier","id":"c276","house":"kite","letter":"L327","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":5100,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT NORTH BANK EAST.","cipher":"AKWINJ, DKHO TS JKQSD ATJG NTRS."},{"seq":759,"t":4800,"type":"courier","id":"c